CB22 B6C1C7           (      storage.asm):00028 (4)             lda     CFSTATR
CB25 8401             (      storage.asm):00029 (2)             anda    #CFERRB
CB27 2703             (      storage.asm):00030 (3)             beq     @cfeck1
