DCCD BDCC34           (        forth.asm):04089 (7)             jsr     MIN2PST         2 parameters need to be stacked up
                      (        forth.asm):04090         * Register allocation notes:
                      (        forth.asm):04091         * X: pointer to ud1 (ARG_U/p in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04092         * Y: pointer to ud2 (ARG_V/q in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04093         * E: Inner loop index (i in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04094         * F: Outer loop index (j in the C code).
                      (        forth.asm):04095         *
                      (        forth.asm):04096         * We save U to the system stack and use it to point to a scratch area allocated
                      (        forth.asm):04097         * from the system stack that will contain the 4 bytes (double cell) ultimately
                      (        forth.asm):04098         * holding the result (MSB first, what else?).
                      (        forth.asm):04099         *
                      (        forth.asm):04100         * System stack structure:
                      (        forth.asm):04101         * ,S    Result scratch area (Result MSB)
                      (        forth.asm):04102         * 2,S   Result scratch area (Result LSB)
                      (        forth.asm):04103         * 4,S   Saved U register
